OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 26 NOV
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GExclusive music-making including
OL,6,     GMozart's celebrated Sinfonia
OL,7,     GConcertante and highlights from
OL,8,     Gthis year's Bath Mozartfest and
OL,9,     Grecent concert recordings from
OL,10,     GFreiburg Baroque.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from the Chapel of King's
OL,13,     GCollege, London, with music by
OL,14,     GStanford, Coleridge-Taylor and
OL,15,     GElgar.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Max Roach
OL,17,     GKate Molleson is joined by Kevin
OL,18,     GLeGendre to explore the life and
OL,19,     Gwork of drummer and composer Max
OL,20,     GRoach. Today focusing on Max
OL,21,     GRoach as a political force.
